<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>RAG Starter</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f7fa; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; }
    main { max-width: 850px; margin: auto; }
    h1 { color: #243447; }
    .card { background: white; padding: 24px; margin: 18px 0; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; }
    .card h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; }
    .button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>RAG Starter</h1>
    <p>RD4.3 — Vector Embeddings and Retrieval-Augmented Generation</p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Products</h2>
      <p>View products, upload PDFs and ask product-specific questions.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/products">Open Products</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Semantic Search</h2>
      <p>Find relevant product information using vector embeddings.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/products/search?q=retirement">Open Semantic Search</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>RAG Chat</h2>
      <p>Ask questions using information retrieved from uploaded PDFs.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/rag">Open RAG Chat</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
